{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"170440","name":"SUN HOTEL KINETA Beach front","description":"Sun Hotel is a family establishment located in the beautiful beach of Kineta only 40 minutes from Athens. It offers an extraordinary combination of the beauties of both sea and mountain. If you are looking for relaxation and spending your day at the beach sun tanning, our hotel is the perfect place to do so. When it comes to food, our restaurant offers a selection of traditional dishes for unbeatable prices, than you can enjoy at the seaside. A mesmerizing sunset is an idyllic background while you have a drink at our beach bar, socializing with other travelers. You are but a breath away from Athens, Corinth, Delphi, Epidaurus, Nafplio, Mycenae and of course islands like Hydra, Poros and Aegina that can be seen through a one-day cruise. On the other hand if you don't feel like travelling, Kineta offers you a selection of beach bars and restaurants by the sea.","address":"Paralia Kinetas, Terma Nireos, Kineta","city":"KINETA","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"19100","lat":37.975419,"lng":23.239701,"stars":2,"giataCode":"359452","phone":"+306943185161","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_006_20260115_100558.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_008_20260115_100930.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/17/170440/170440a_hb_a_009_20260115_101101.jpg","